<div class="container my-5">
    <h1>Optional Robot Expansion</h1>
    <p>We provide to new teams the REV Edu Kit V2. This kit will allow your team to build a robot and compete 
        in the FTC competition. Teams may fundraise money to purchase additional components for your robot. 
        Fundraising and budget is a component of the engineering portfolio. We recommend teams fundraise money 
        to expand the capabilities of their robot and for team spirit through materials like team shirts.</p>

    <div class="table-responsive-lg">
        <table class="table">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th scope="col"></th>
                    <th scope="col">Name</th>
                    <th scope="col">Description</th>
                    <th scope="col">Cost</th>
                    <th scope="col">Link</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td><img style="max-width: 200px;" <%-IMAGE("ftc/robot_kits/edu_kit_to_ftc_v3.1.webp")%> /></td>
                    <td>EDU Kit V2 to Starter Kit V3.1 Upgrade</td>
                    <td>This kit provides your team with an aditional motors and servos alongside many mechanical components such as brackets, gears, screws, and aluminum extrusions.</td>
                    <td>$607.50</td>
                    <td><a target="_blank" href="https://revrobotics.ca/rev-45-2194/" class="btn text-white bg-ftc-orange"> REV Robotics Canada <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i></a></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><img style="max-width: 200px;" <%-IMAGE("ftc/robot_kits/extrusion_lift_kit.webp")%> /></td>
                    <td>15mm Extrusion Lift Kit</td>
                    <td>This kit contains mechanical components to be able to build a 3-stage <a target="_blank" href="https://docs.revrobotics.com/duo-build/linear-motion-kit/three-stage-continuous-lift">continuous</a> or <a target="_blank" href="https://docs.revrobotics.com/duo-build/linear-motion-kit/three-stage-cascading-lift">cascading</a> lift.</td>
                    <td>$126.50</td>
                    <td><a target="_blank" href="https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-45-1900/" class="btn text-white bg-ftc-orange"> REV Robotics Canada <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i></a></td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container my-5">
    <h1>CAD Software</h1>
    <a target="_blank" href="https://ftc-docs.firstinspires.org/en/latest/sponsors/software/software.html" class="btn text-white bg-ftc-orange my-2"> FTC Docs <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i></a>
    <p>Computer Aided Design (CAD) and 3D animation software is used in FIRST Tech Challenge by teams to design and visualize complex systems prior to manufacturing.</p>
    <p>As a benefit of being a FIRST Tech Challenge Team, some sponsors of FIRST programs have generously provided complimentary software, licenses, and/or support to teams.
        Many of these licenses are valid for one year and must be renewed annually. Sometimes sponsored content require the use of a donation voucher provided in your FIRST Dashboard team account, 
        sometimes sponsors merely require your Team number and contact information, and some software is simply provided free of charge with no proof of registration requirement.
    </p>
    
